# Resilience Explorer vs DRMIS – Feature Comparison
# Resilience Explorer vs DRMIS – Feature Comparison
**DRMIS** (Disaster Risk Management Information System) is Vanuatu’s custom platform for NDMO and MoCCA. It is built with **Django** (backend) and **React** (frontend).
